schema_id: atlas.qdrant-query-budget
schema_version: 1
schema_kind: retrieval_runtime_budget
status: ACTIVE

description: >
  Query-time quality/cost controls for Qdrant as an executor behind the single
  canonical semantic_768 lane.

fields:
  schema: { type: literal, value: atlas.qdrant-query-budget.v1 }
  limit: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
  oversampling: { type: number, minimum: 1 }
  rescoreOriginal: { type: boolean }
  exact: { type: boolean }
  hnswEf: { type: integer, minimum: 1, nullable: true }
  policyRevision: { type: string, required: true }

invariants:
  - Qdrant execution produces one logical semantic vote per canonical candidate
  - oversampling and rescoring are measured runtime dials, not global constants
  - exact=true is an executor mode, not a new retrieval lane
